WEBVTT

00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:32.456
So, let's fire it up and see what it does.

00:00:37.887 --> 00:00:39.778
So let's play a 550-herz frequency

00:00:39.778 --> 00:00:41.293
and watch what happens.

00:00:41.342 --> 00:00:49.825
(Frequency)

00:00:49.825 --> 00:00:52.538
Thank you. (Applause)

00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:54.526
It's okay to applaud the laws of physics,

00:00:54.526 --> 00:00:55.982
but essentially what's happening here

00:00:55.982 --> 00:00:57.742
-- (Laughter) --

00:00:57.742 --> 00:01:01.750
is the energy from the sound via the air and gas molecules